{"id":"re_colte","lemma":"récolte","pos":"noun","rank":3809,"glosses":["harvest"],"ipa":"/ʁe.kɔlt/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d3/Fr-r%C3%A9colte.ogg/Fr-r%C3%A9colte.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"récoltes"},"examples":[{"text":"Nous avons tous aidé à la récolte.","en":"We all helped with the harvest.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"all"},{"g":"to help","l":"aider"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[4,6,"a la"]]},{"text":"On s'attend à une bonne récolte cette année.","en":"We're expecting a good harvest this year.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"oneself / if"},{"g":"to wait for, to await","l":"attendre"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},null,{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"year"}]},{"text":"Tu récoltes ce que tu as semé.","en":"You reap what you sow.","words":[{"g":"you"},null,null,null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to sow","l":"semer"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"what"]]},{"text":"Un sol riche produit de bonnes récoltes.","en":"Rich soil yields good crops.","words":[{"g":"a"},{"g":"soil, earth"},{"g":"rich"},{"g":"product"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},null]},{"text":"Nous avons eu une mauvaise récolte l'an dernier.","en":"We had a bad harvest last year.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"bad","l":"mauvais"},null,{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"year"},{"g":"last"}]}]}